---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Community rules"
	description="Community rules for the Unofficial MGC Community Marketplace."
	currentPath="/rules/"
>
	<section class="hero">
		<p class="hero-kicker">How we run this</p>
		<h1>Community rules</h1>
		<p class="hero-lead">
			These rules keep the marketplace clear, fair, and clearly unofficial — for people actively tied to
			the MGC umbrella.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="section rules">
		<div class="panel">
			<ol>
				<li>
					<strong>Affiliation required to list.</strong> Businesses and professionals listed here must
					be run by people who are actively affiliated with MGC Main, MGC Global, MGCNLCA, and/or the
					MGCNLCA Alumni Community.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Open to browse.</strong> Anyone can access the site and directory. Public visitors do
					not need MGC affiliation to look around.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>No official branding.</strong> We must never use official MGC or MGCNLCA logos or
					design elements. This project is community-run and unofficial.
				</li>
			</ol>

			<h2>Scope</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>We list businesses and professionals by category.</li>
				<li>We do not list individual products or services as catalog items.</li>
				<li>Business pages may include an outlink to the business’s own website or contact channel.</li>
			</ul>

			<p class="notice" style="margin-bottom:0">
				Full prose also lives in <code>COMMUNITY_RULES.md</code> in the repository for contributors.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
